                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d12a835-0a7f-4bd2-9666-920bbfb1831a",
                                                "sense_id": "d6726310-4d33-3a1f-b25a-e28f693ad7e6",
                                                "text": "\"Bradford? I didn't know you called him Bradford.\" \"That's just one more thing you don't know about me. I call him Bradford because it makes me feel like I'm in a soap opera. That's what they name men on soap operas. Bradford and Desmond and Elliott and Royce. - - -"
